# Pencil, brush (pressure, aa), eraser patterns.
doc 160 120
noise 3 opaque
fg FF0000
bg 00FF0080
tool Pencil
drag L 5 5 150 100 12
drag R 150 5 5 110 7
dump pencil
sel-ellipse 20 20 120 80
tool Brush
set brush 9
drag L 0 60 160 60 9
set aa 0
drag R 80 0 80 120 5
set aa 1
set alphablend 0
fg 2040FF80
drag L 10 10 140 110 6
set alphablend 1
dump brush-sel
sel-none
set pressure 1
pressure 0.3
down 20 100 L
pressure 0.6
move 60 90
pressure 1
move 100 95
pressure 0.1
move 140 105
up 140 105 L
dump brush-pressure
set pressure 0
pressure 0.2
drag L 20 30 140 30 4
dump brush-nopressure
pressure 1
tool Eraser
set brush 15
set eraser Solid
drag L 10 50 150 50 5
set eraser Horizontal
drag L 10 70 150 70 5
set eraser DiagonalCross
drag L 10 90 150 90 5
set eraser Checkerboard
drag L 30 0 30 120 5
set eraser Percent25
drag L 60 0 60 120 5
set eraser DottedGrid
drag L 90 0 90 120 5
set eraser BackwardDiagonal
drag L 120 0 120 120 5
dump eraser
undo
undo
dump eraser-undo2
colors paint
